   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Ordering at the restaurant",
     "texto": [
      "**Queria** (I wanted) + something: **Queria um peixe grelhado** (I wanted a grilled fish).",
      "To ask for something to be brought: **Pode trazer água?** (can you bring water?)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Recommend and the dish of the day",
     "texto": [
      "The waiter can recommend it: **Recomendo o prato do dia** (I recommend the dish of the day). The customer can ask for a recommendation: **Pode recomendar-me um prato?** (can you recommend a dish to me?).",
      "**Bom apetite** (enjoy your meal) is said before eating."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "The bill",
     "texto": [
      "To ask for it, say **A conta, por favor** (the bill, please). **Mais tarde** means «later»; don't add it to the request if you want the bill brought now."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
